msgstr "ලොගය"

#: appinstaller.rs:1196
msgid "_Close"
msgstr "වසන්න(_C)"

#: appinstaller.rs:1206
msgid "The Installation Was Successful"
msgstr "ස්ථාපනය සාර්ථකයි"

#: appinstaller.rs:1206
msgid "The app was installed."
msgstr "යෙදුම ස්ථාපනය කරන ලදී."

